CoMAP tau3 adaptation

This implementation adapts the draft/world-model/reflection design and the
public WMSD/SDPO loss formulas from loyiv/CoMAP, commit
 a5f6e2d2a0aff571f9a5441bf82a796a724ea94d.
The upstream CoMAP code is distributed under Apache License 2.0; a copy is
included in LICENSE. Modified/adapted behavior and source mapping are documented
in README.md. The tau2 benchmark is used as a separate dependency and retains
its own license.
